Package: material-plymouth
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, material-boot-core (>= 1.0.0), plymouth, plymouth-label, initramfs-tools | dracut, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pil
Description: Material 3 Expressive boot splash (Plymouth) that continues the Material GRUB theme
 The same colours and per-distro look as the Material GRUB theme, an animated
 cookie and shapes, the Material 3 Expressive wavy loading bar, the disk-password
 prompt and the shutdown and update messages. It is a part of Material Boot
 (material-boot plymouth ...) and is managed from material-grub's GUI too. Installing the package
 does not change how the system boots: turning the splash on rebuilds the
 initramfs and may edit the kernel command line, so it is a step of your own.
